From e54928d758f932e541add864bd232f975fb8dd19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shitiz Garg <mail@shitiz.me>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:59:07 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] MinGW and ARM64EC build of DXC 1.8.2407 for Madeira

Based on raedrizqie's MinGW patch set (microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler#8265,
unmerged), adapted to v1.8.2407, plus:
- CFG.h: rename the CALLBACK template parameter (windows.h macro)
- DxilContainerReflection.cpp: avoid UNREFERENCED_PARAMETER on a reference
- dxcvalidator.cpp: ETW header only with MSVC
- Host.cpp: no x86 cpuid asm on ARM64EC (clang defines __x86_64__ there)
- dxcapi.use.cpp: Windows DLL names (MinGW's lib prefix broke dxil.dll lookup)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
